    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm running a quick review of the upcoming Q4 infrastructure updates. Can you pull up the specs for the new Decentralized Energy Protocol (DEP-2026) and give me a quick assessment of how shifting from your current centralized load balancing to the local hardware switch model will impact our frequency stability margins?",
